# Performance

This worker must be fast as well as correct. Follow [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Do

- Fit in one **O(n)** pass (`FitSeasonalBaseline` minute-of-week)
- Pre-size times/values to the Druid series length
- Fill `Forecast(N)` in one O(N) loop; publish only the last point
- Add or update tests when changing the tick hot path

## Do not

- Nested O(n²) scans over observations
- Re-fit on every horizon step
- Clone the training series unless a helper needs an independent copy
- Add SIMD, GPU, or a parallel API without updating INTENTIONS
